{"3900670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Phantom Void", "steam_appid": 3900670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">CONTROL THE UNKNOWN, BECOME UNSTOPPABLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phantom Void</strong> is a cinematic action sci-fi horror set in a shattered dystopian future where humanity is obsolete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following a cataclysmic portal collapse triggered by inhuman experiments, Earth has fallen into ruin. You awaken amidst the debris not as a survivor, but as a test subject—altered, enhanced, and hunted. With the terrified realization that you can possess your enemies and absorb their capabilities, you must turn your hunters into your arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a collapsing reality ruled by a ruthless alien regime. Engage in visceral, physics-driven combat, master a deep progression system, and unravel a dark, atmospheric narrative that reacts to your decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR ARSENAL</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONTROL YOUR ENEMIES:</strong> Every new foe is a new opportunity. Infiltrate their bodies, seize their forms, and add their powers as a new branch to your ever-growing skill tree. Turn their own mastery against them. In a world where you can claim their flesh, there is no death for you—only an end for them!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900670/extras/8f46ea46f9c37f7a77449f384f1aa117.poster.avif?t=1767889674\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900670/extras/8f46ea46f9c37f7a77449f384f1aa117.webm?t=1767889674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900670/extras/8f46ea46f9c37f7a77449f384f1aa117.mp4?t=1767889674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MASTER ADVANCED WEAPONRY:</strong> Combine unique abilities and weapon mods with lethal precision. Become the conductor of chaos, orchestrating destruction on the battlefield like never before.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900670/extras/d83c85f781016627630ee9b361884744.poster.avif?t=1767889674\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900670/extras/d83c85f781016627630ee9b361884744.webm?t=1767889674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900670/extras/d83c85f781016627630ee9b361884744.mp4?t=1767889674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WEAPONIZE THE ENVIRONMENT:</strong> The world is as much a weapon as the rifle in your hand. Solve environmental puzzles, manipulate debris through telekinesis, and use the surroundings to crush your enemies. Every encounter is a playground of destruction waiting for your command.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900670/extras/067347b3469d502371a7ac82f669066a.poster.avif?t=1767889674\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900670/extras/067347b3469d502371a7ac82f669066a.webm?t=1767889674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900670/extras/067347b3469d502371a7ac82f669066a.mp4?t=1767889674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNRAVEL YOUR FATE:</strong> Immerse yourself in a hauntingly beautiful nightmare. <strong>Phantom Void</strong> delivers high-fidelity visuals and emotional storytelling as it drags you through shattered cities, sterile alien labs, and warped dimensions to uncover the horrific truth behind your transformation.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900670/extras/3befd1121a764900035d64ffdf1283c6.poster.avif?t=1767889674\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900670/extras/3befd1121a764900035d64ffdf1283c6.webm?t=1767889674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900670/extras/3befd1121a764900035d64ffdf1283c6.mp4?t=1767889674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">CONTROL THE UNKNOWN, BECOME UNSTOPPABLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phantom Void</strong> is a cinematic action sci-fi horror set in a shattered dystopian future where humanity is obsolete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following a cataclysmic portal collapse triggered by inhuman experiments, Earth has fallen into ruin. You awaken amidst the debris not as a survivor, but as a test subject—altered, enhanced, and hunted. With the terrified realization that you can possess your enemies and absorb their capabilities, you must turn your hunters into your arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a collapsing reality ruled by a ruthless alien regime. Engage in visceral, physics-driven combat, master a deep progression system, and unravel a dark, atmospheric narrative that reacts to your decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR ARSENAL</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONTRO