nvironmental puzzles, manipulate debris through telekinesis, and use the surroundings to crush your enemies. Every encounter is a playground of destruction waiting for your command.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900670/extras/067347b3469d502371a7ac82f669066a.poster.avif?t=1767889674\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900670/extras/067347b3469d502371a7ac82f669066a.webm?t=1767889674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900670/extras/067347b3469d502371a7ac82f669066a.mp4?t=1767889674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNRAVEL YOUR FATE:</strong> Immerse yourself in a hauntingly beautiful nightmare. <strong>Phantom Void</strong> delivers high-fidelity visuals and emotional storytelling as it drags you through shattered cities, sterile alien labs, and warped dimensions to uncover the horrific truth behind your transformation.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900670/extras/3befd1121a764900035d64ffdf1283c6.poster.avif?t=1767889674\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900670/extras/3befd1121a764900035d64ffdf1283c6.webm?t=1767889674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900670/extras/3befd1121a764900035d64ffdf1283c6.mp4?t=1767889674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Possess enemies, steal their powers, and shape your evolution in a cinematic sci-fi horror set in a collapsing dystopian world. Build your stren